Deposit_AcrossAdapter_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when inputAmount zero
│  └── it should revert with InvalidAmount
└── when inputAmount non zero
   ├── when route not allowed
   │  └── it should revert with RouteNotAllowed
   ├── when message not empty
   │  └── it should revert with MessageNotAllowed
   ├── when outputAmount below floor
   │  └── it should revert with SlippageTooLow
   └── when valid
      ├── it should pull inputAmount from the vault
      ├── it should forward depositor as the vault
      ├── it should forward the params to the spokePool
      ├── it should append the referral tag
      ├── it should reset spokePool allowance to zero
      ├── it should emit AdapterAction
      └── it should return inputAmount
